### Stage 3: try these with the VS Code REST Client while `cds watch` runs
@host = http://localhost:4004
@alice = Basic alice:
@bob = Basic bob:

### Read requests with items and supplier
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/request/PurchaseRequests?$expand=items,supplier
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Filter by total
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/request/PurchaseRequests?$filter=total gt 1000
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Deep insert: header with items
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/request/PurchaseRequests
Authorization: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Docking stations",
  "supplier_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "currency_code": "EUR",
  "items": [ { "product": "USB-C dock", "quantity": 5, "price": 180 } ]
}

### Submit a request (bound action)
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/request/PurchaseRequests(b1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000001)/submit
Authorization: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Open requests for approvers
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/approval/OpenRequests
Authorization: {{bob}}

### Approve (unbound action)
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/approval/approve
Authorization: {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "request": "b1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002", "comment": "Looks good" }
